  <entry>
    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2510.01299v3</id>
    <title>Domain-Specific Agents for Cherenkov Telescope Array Control Software and Gamma-Ray Data Analysis</title>
    <updated>2026-06-24T02:06:11Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.01299v3" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.01299v3" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We present domain-adapted large language model agents designed to support Cherenkov Telescope Array operation and data analysis. The agents combine contextual knowledge with automated validation and iterative correction to produce more reliable outputs. This approach reduces manual effort, improves consistency, and helps accelerate operational and scientific workflows. The results demonstrate the potential of agentic systems as practical assistants in specialized research environments.</summary>
    <category term="astro-ph.IM" scheme="http://arxiv.org/schemas/atom"/>
    <category term="cs.AI" scheme="http://arxiv.org/schemas/atom"/>
